{"page":159,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"기7 • 소켓 프로그래밍: 네트워크 0H를리게이션 생성","words":[{"text":"기7","x":780,"y":145,"width":38,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":848,"y":153,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"소켓","x":889,"y":148,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"프로그래밍:","x":949,"y":147,"width":141,"height":30},{"text":"네트워크","x":1106,"y":147,"width":104,"height":29},{"text":"0H를리게이션","x":1221,"y":146,"width":154,"height":30},{"text":"생성","x":1387,"y":145,"width":51,"height":30}]},{"text":"한다. TCP 연결의 한쪽은 클라이언트 소켓에 연결되고 다른 쪽은 서버 소켓에 연결된","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":183,"y":274,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":269,"y":278,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"연결의","x":358,"y":273,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"한쪽은","x":471,"y":274,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트","x":583,"y":275,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"소켓에","x":758,"y":273,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"연결되고","x":866,"y":273,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1007,"y":274,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"쪽은","x":1087,"y":275,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"서버","x":1169,"y":275,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"소켓에","x":1248,"y":274,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"연결된","x":1362,"y":272,"width":97,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. TCP 연결을 생성할 때 클라이언트 소켓 주소(IP 주소와 포트 번호)와 서버 소켓","words":[{"text":"다.","x":183,"y":336,"width":38,"height":36},{"text":"TCP","x":237,"y":338,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"연결을","x":328,"y":334,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"생성할","x":444,"y":334,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":561,"y":334,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트","x":607,"y":334,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"소켓","x":784,"y":333,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"주소(IP","x":861,"y":334,"width":107,"height":35},{"text":"주소와","x":985,"y":334,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"포트","x":1102,"y":338,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"번호)와","x":1187,"y":334,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"서버","x":1314,"y":333,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"소켓","x":1394,"y":333,"width":64,"height":37}]},{"text":"주소(IP 주소와 포트 번화를 연결과 연관시킨다(associate). TCP 연결이 설정된 후,","words":[{"text":"주소(IP","x":182,"y":397,"width":112,"height":36},{"text":"주소와","x":310,"y":394,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"포트","x":430,"y":398,"width":67,"height":27},{"text":"번화를","x":516,"y":394,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"연결과","x":644,"y":393,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"연관시킨다(associate).","x":756,"y":392,"width":325,"height":40},{"text":"TCP","x":1099,"y":398,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"연결이","x":1189,"y":394,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"설정된","x":1305,"y":392,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"후,","x":1419,"y":393,"width":42,"height":37}]},{"text":"한쪽에서 다른 쪽으로 데이터를 보내려면 소켓을 통해 데이터를 TCP 연결로 보내면","words":[{"text":"한쪽에서","x":182,"y":453,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":331,"y":454,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"쪽으로","x":414,"y":456,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"데이터를","x":533,"y":453,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"보내려면","x":678,"y":452,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"소켓을","x":822,"y":451,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"통해","x":930,"y":452,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"데이터를","x":1014,"y":453,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":1160,"y":458,"width":70,"height":29},{"text":"연결로","x":1249,"y":454,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"보내면","x":1362,"y":453,"width":99,"height":36}]},{"text":"된다. 이것이 UDP와 다른 부분이며, UDP에서는 서버가 패것을 소켓에 제공하기 전","words":[{"text":"된다.","x":182,"y":514,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"이것이","x":272,"y":513,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"UDP와","x":390,"y":513,"width":112,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":517,"y":513,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"부분이며,","x":598,"y":512,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"UDP에서는","x":752,"y":512,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"서버가","x":936,"y":512,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"패것을","x":1052,"y":513,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"소켓에","x":1166,"y":513,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"제공하기","x":1282,"y":512,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"전","x":1432,"y":513,"width":29,"height":36}]},{"text":"에 패킷에 목적지 주소를 붙여야 한다.","words":[{"text":"에","x":182,"y":575,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"패킷에","x":226,"y":574,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"목적지","x":338,"y":573,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"주소를","x":453,"y":574,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"붙여야","x":566,"y":573,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":677,"y":573,"width":71,"height":37}]},{"text":"이제 TCP에서의 클라이언트와 서버 프로그램의 상호작용에 대해 보다 자세히 살","words":[{"text":"이제","x":246,"y":634,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"TCP에서의","x":324,"y":633,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":513,"y":633,"width":199,"height":38},{"text":"서버","x":725,"y":633,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램의","x":801,"y":632,"width":158,"height":37},{"text":"상호작용에","x":976,"y":633,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":1158,"y":634,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"보다","x":1238,"y":634,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"자세히","x":1318,"y":633,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"살","x":1430,"y":633,"width":34,"height":37}]},{"text":"펴보자. 클라이언트는 서버로의 접속을 먼저 시도한다. 서버는 클라이언트의 초기 접","words":[{"text":"펴보자.","x":182,"y":695,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트는","x":304,"y":695,"width":205,"height":37},{"text":"서버로의","x":525,"y":693,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"접속을","x":673,"y":693,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"먼저","x":785,"y":694,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"시도한다.","x":864,"y":692,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"서버는","x":1019,"y":694,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"클라이언트의","x":1133,"y":694,"width":198,"height":38},{"text":"초기","x":1350,"y":694,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"접","x":1432,"y":694,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"속에 응대할 수 있도록 준비하고 있어야 한다. 여기에는 두 가지 의미가 있다. 첫째,","words":[{"text":"속에","x":180,"y":756,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"응대할","x":261,"y":756,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":381,"y":756,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"있도록","x":434,"y":755,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"준비하고","x":548,"y":754,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"있어야","x":698,"y":753,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":809,"y":753,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"여기에는","x":900,"y":752,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1047,"y":756,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"가지","x":1098,"y":754,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"의미가","x":1182,"y":755,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1299,"y":755,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"첫째,","x":1391,"y":754,"width":72,"height":37}]},{"text":"UDP에서와 마찬가지로, TCP 서버는 클라이언트가 접속을 시도하기 전에 프로세스를","words":[{"text":"UDP에서와","x":181,"y":817,"width":177,"height":38},{"text":"마찬가지로,","x":370,"y":816,"width":177,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":560,"y":819,"width":70,"height":29},{"text":"서버는","x":644,"y":814,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트가","x":752,"y":813,"width":196,"height":38},{"text":"접속을","x":961,"y":813,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"시도하기","x":1074,"y":815,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"전에","x":1220,"y":816,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1298,"y":815,"width":166,"height":37}]},{"text":"먼저 수행하고 있어야 한다. 둘째, 서버 프로그램은 임의의 컴퓨터에서 수행되고 있는","words":[{"text":"먼저","x":182,"y":878,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"수행하고","x":259,"y":878,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"있어야","x":411,"y":877,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":525,"y":876,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"둘째,","x":614,"y":874,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"서버","x":702,"y":874,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램은","x":779,"y":874,"width":164,"height":36},{"text":"임의의","x":959,"y":873,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터에서","x":1072,"y":875,"width":161,"height":38},{"text":"수행되고","x":1250,"y":876,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"있는","x":1400,"y":876,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"클라이언트로부터의 초기 접속을 처리하는 특별한 출입문(즉, 특별한 소켓)을 가져야","words":[{"text":"클라이언트로부터의","x":180,"y":938,"width":299,"height":38},{"text":"초기","x":498,"y":937,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"접속을","x":581,"y":935,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"처리하는","x":695,"y":935,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"특별한","x":838,"y":934,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"출입문(즉,","x":950,"y":934,"width